WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.263
Choose Shifts for rostered work at a
workplace.

00:00:04.113 --> 00:00:06.365
You'll build the plan here without needing
an account.

00:00:07.565 --> 00:00:11.128
Add the workplace name and, if it's useful,
a location.

00:00:12.028 --> 00:00:15.297
Check the time zone too, especially if you
work across different zones.

00:00:16.547 --> 00:00:19.200
Open a shift type to check its start and
end times.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.333
An end time earlier than the start means it
finishes the next day.

00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:26.031
Now build the repeating pattern.

00:00:26.881 --> 00:00:28.939
Tap a day to cycle through your shift
types.

00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:31.972
Here we're changing the first day to Off.

00:00:32.872 --> 00:00:35.046
Check the pattern's start date before
continuing.

00:00:36.296 --> 00:00:38.413
Read the review, then finish setup.

00:00:39.613 --> 00:00:43.501
Check Calendar and Today against your
original roster before relying on the plan.

00:00:44.401 --> 00:00:48.154
A one-off change later belongs in Calendar,
not in this repeating pattern.
